WEBVTT

00:01:29.847 --> 00:01:32.175
proud of the American dream,

00:01:32.199 --> 00:01:36.180
a dream that just won't be complete
without higher education.

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:40.589
But Debbie doesn't have the savings
for higher education.

00:01:40.613 --> 00:01:42.523
She can't pay the tuition.

00:01:42.881 --> 00:01:44.829
Neither could she leave work.

00:01:46.094 --> 00:01:47.277
Meet Wael.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.145
Wael is from Syria.

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:52.187
He's experiencing firsthand

00:01:53.528 --> 00:01:57.554
the misery, fear and failure
imposed on his country.

00:01:58.755 --> 00:02:01.306
He's a big believer in education.